Third-party and upstream materials
==================================

This package may include or reference materials that are not covered by the
MIT License of the authors' scripts:

1. CZII cryo-ET portal dataset 10440
   https://cryoetdataportal.czscience.com/datasets/10440
   Terms: as published by the Chan Zuckerberg Institute Imaging / portal.

2. DeepDeWedge tutorial archive (Figshare file 45582309)
   https://api.figshare.com/v2/file/download/45582309
   Related software: https://github.com/MLI-lab/DeepDeWedge

3. cryoCARE / csbdeep / TensorFlow stack
   https://github.com/juglab/cryoCARE_pip
   Package versions used for the demonstration fit are recorded in
   experiments/revision_20261003_extension/environment_cryocare.json

4. Topaz and other denoising tools referenced by environment_main.json
   Use the recorded package lists; do not assume redistributed GPUs or
   full training corpora are included.

Hashes, download timestamps, and provenance JSON files in this repository
are provided so that retrieved upstream bytes can be verified. Presence of a
hash does not change upstream ownership or license.
